<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!advpm__Matter__c.Name_of_Borrower__c}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">,&nbsp;</span><font face="arial">is in default on its loan agreement with Quick Bridge Funding, LLC and you are in default on the related guaranty.&nbsp; The Loan Agreement has been assigned and transferred to National Funding, Inc., Quick Bridge’s parent company.&nbsp; To collect on this default we are a prepared to file suit against you and the company.&nbsp; Attached is a draft copy of the complaint we will be filing with the court in the next few days if we don’t hear from you regarding repayment.&nbsp; Please contact us so we can work out a repayment arrangement otherwise we will move forward with litigation and you and the business will be subject to additional court costs and attorney’s fees.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I look forward to hearing from you.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Best Regards,&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Title}</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!advpm__Matter__c.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><div>{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</div><div>{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</span></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
